cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use slitherFlow, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "slitherFlow: subway maps for Snakemake pipelines"
abstract: >-
  slitherFlow turns a Snakemake pipeline into a subway-map figure. It reads the
  pipeline's rule graph, writes a first draft of the map as an editable YAML
  file, and draws it as SVG, PNG or PDF.
authors:
  - family-names: Martinez
    given-names: Mike
version: 1.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/mikemartinez99/slitherFlow"
url: "https://mikemartinez99.github.io/slitherFlow/"
keywords:
  - Snakemake
  - bioinformatics
  - workflow
  - pipeline diagram
  - subway map
  - visualization
